  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1202.43 Conversion varnish",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1202.43 \"Conversion varnish\" means a special water-resistant varnish used primarily for wood cabinets and trim installed in kitchens, bathrooms, and other environments where water resistance is important.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
